## API / Server Endpoints (suggested)

- POST /api/payments/create
  - Body: { codeReviewId: string, amount?: number, returnUrl?: string }
  - Creates PaymentRequest doc and returns { paymentRequestId, walletAddress, paymentURI, amount, expiresAt }
- POST /api/payments/verify
  - Body (server-to-server): { paymentRequestId, txHash }
  - Verifies tx and marks confirmed if valid
- POST /api/payments/webhook
  - Optional webhook receiver for provider notifications — must validate signatures server-side

