## Security & Ops Notes

- Provide `.env.example` keys only; actual RPC credentials and service accounts must live in CI/secret manager.
- Use Firestore security rules to ensure only server processes set `status` to `confirmed` and only the purchaser can access vault content.
- Log payment events for auditability (audit log collection).

